      "writtenOn": "2024-10-15T00:22:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For artifacts (libs/bins/apps) that are included inside the apex, the respective `partition` property of the packaging spec is set to `apex`. I would like to elide them from the packaging of the top-level filesystem.\n\nIIUC, would you prefer that that we do so by using a new property in `PackagingSpec` named `apexArtifactDoNotIncludeInFilesystem`?\n\nAs an alternative, WDYT about replacing\n```\n(ps.Partition() \u003d\u003d f.PartitionType())\n```\nwith\n```\n(ps.Partition() !\u003d \"apex\")\n```\n?",
